  "details": "sometimes people change their banner for a certain season of the year, this helps people absorb the holyday or to have a little change sometimes\n\nExample\n\n for example Kishidumbpuppy's high n tied, at the moment has a banner with pumpkins in the background, now imagine your own group but maybe with Halloween things, or when it's Christmas imagine your group image with Christmas decorations\n\nHow?\n\nthis could potentially be automated by having multiple image slots and setting those to be from date 1 to date 2 available and replacing the original banner\n\nWhy?\n\nso you won't have to change it each holyday and each time something big happens",
